Z||000003||Ed||01-28-2000||07:18 PM||||Zero electrical problems with an '87 GT. <P>Normal replacement items for a car of this age: Sensors, bulbs, spark plug wires, etc. ||||reg||1
Z||000004||theogre||01-28-2000||07:43 PM||||Other than the blue dingy thingy being known for being cronicly annoying and the miswiring of the coolant gauge/light wiring there are no major elecrical problems I know of that are common to the line.<P>Only things I'm seeing are the typical aging problems all old cars get.||||reg||1
