Z||000006||WKDFIRO||01-29-2000||04:32 AM||||My problems with my 85 GT were caused by the previous owner having illusions that he was some kind of electrician...my wife's 87 4 cyl auto now theres a nightmare....had to change out the lightbulb that illuminates the gear selection...that car has gone to hell, last year she burned out a headlight...can you believe it? Whats next? The other headlight??? You would think these things would have no problems with only 267,000 miles on it....go figure!<p>[This message has been edited by WKDFIRO (edited 01-29-2000).]||||reg||12
