Z||000012||stimpy||01-30-2000||08:45 AM||||The only issue that I am dealing with regarding electronics is a non-functioning temp guage and a demonically posessed wiper control. Any feedback onhow to best attack the wiper problem, most appreciated.  138k miles on the car, 1 headlight motor replaced. sdm1964, that little light in the front compartment is wired to the headlights. Have you tried turning your headlights on? If not, don't feel bad, someone had to tell me too.||||reg||1
